review_comments.body:
Would it be something like:
```nix
{
    baseModules = [
      (lib.modules.importApply ${pkgs.path}/lib/services/service.nix { inherit pkgs; })
    ];
}
```

That just seems janky/hacky to pull to setup a service.nix. IMO ideally do we want a way where you import the lib and it handles this for you or exposes a separate function.

